      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Colors and styles\n\nShapes have a `style` input. Style nodes (Fill, Stroke, NoFill…) build up a style value. Color nodes (Color, Palette…) build colour values.\n\nHere: Color (pink) → Fill → Rect.style. Open the Color node to swap modes (rgb / hsl / hex).",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Colors and styles\n\nShapes have a `style` input. Style nodes (Fill, Stroke, NoFill…) build up a style value. Color nodes (Color, Palette…) build colour values.\n\nHere: Color (pink) → Fill → Rect.style. Open the Color node to swap modes (rgb / hsl / hex).",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 200
      }
